    32	manifest mechanically with `awk -F=` from the receipt's indexed
    33	`charged_input_<i>_sha256` and `_basename` fields, pointing directly to that
    34	`/tmp` directory, then ran `sha256sum -c`.  All 8/8 entries returned `OK`.
