    99	## 3. Patched engine: complete change accounting
   100	
   101	The precise engine SHA-256 is
   102	`76d8c7206f70ba190d1a21fff812c016cbde497cd64071c29c91cfe8089f3c06`.
   103	The line-complete 350-line unified diff is `band_engine.patch`, SHA-256
   104	`b8d638e4fe8a4ce4b12d5930c006203084631909235bd657dde9817639633ec9`.
   105	It is the authoritative documentation of every removed and added line.  A
   106	zero-context reading has 24 atomic change blocks (grouped into 16 ordinary
   107	unified-diff hunks); those atomic changes are classified exhaustively here:
   108	
   109	| atomic blocks / patched lines | effect |
   110	|---|---|
   111	| 1--2 / 2,17--24 | title and explicit repair contract; documentation only |
