   116	| 11--12 / 279--293,295--298 | re-solve the 21 assigned delta=5/2 formulas with `jet0`, retaining `(11,0):0`; add only `jet0` and record both pins |
   117	| 13--14 / 316--317,325--327 | append repaired-series metadata to the unchanged exact leading-minor controls |
   118	| 15 / 402 | fail-closed inner counts `105/103` |
   119	| 16--18 / 571,575--583,587--597 | exact multinomial propagation of `jet0` through `local_rows`; safe minimum-order prefilters |
   120	| 19 / 640--707 | bounded exact-Q point probe with direct cumulative post-major-row substitution on `FOUND`; `NOT_FOUND` is explicitly nonconclusive |
   121	| 20--22 / 831,857,859--862 | call the pin/probe and forbid coexistence of a verified point with a unit basis |
   122	| 23--24 / 881--887,911 | serialize the repair ledger and point-probe record (a certificate only on `FOUND`) |
   123	
   124	For delta=2, setting `j=jet0`, the changed map is the exact centered-series solution
   125	of 18 face equations.  Its free list is
   126	`Hc_7_4,Hc_10_1,Hc_11_0,j,rho,u`; no old free coordinate is removed.  For
   127	delta=5/2 all 21 `Hc` coordinates remain assigned, including `Hc_11_0=0`, and
   128	the free list is exactly `j,u,v,c`.  At `j=0` every formula recovers the
   129	pristine map term-for-term.
