   139	and leader `t^9 zeta^2(zeta+3rho)`; the second has no term below order 21 and
   140	leader `s^21 pi(pi^2-c)`.  Independent regeneration found 18/18 rational unit
   141	pivots on delta=2 and 21/21 after the retained `Hc_11_0=0` row on delta=5/2.
